# yt-dlp, CPython, and PyInstaller

linux/yt-dlp_linux_armv7l.zip is the official yt-dlp armv7l PyInstaller onedir
(release 2026.08.19). The boot hook unpacks it to /media/fat/linux/misterplex/yt-dlp/.

